      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD FORCE (3) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his exceptional 25.23 win at Grafton over 450m. Hard to top on the time from two back. WHISKEY SERVICE (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 1.5 lengths behind Darcy Dakota in 25.69 and recording a new PB here. In form and looks a leading player again. FEDERAL EMERAN (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at Q Parklands in a handy 30.27 beating Majestic Zeal. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from eight starts. Can measure up again. DAYSEA'S SHELLY (7) is a last-start placegetter at big odds who will have admirers.",
